{"action_zh": "先确定强拍、长时值和句尾结构音，再在弱位加入经过、邻接或倚音。", "avoid_zh": "避免先随机生成表面音符再强行解释骨架。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "melody", "structure tone"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-001", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "melody", "structure tone"], "title_zh": "旋律骨架与装饰分层"}
{"action_zh": "先规划上行、下行、拱形或波浪方向，再选择符合调性与可唱性的具体音程。", "avoid_zh": "避免轮廓和每个音程同时无约束变化。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "melody", "contour"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-002", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "melody", "contour"], "title_zh": "轮廓与音程分离"}
{"action_zh": "为一个短句设定常用音域与少数越界高点，候选不得无目的持续扩张。", "avoid_zh": "避免把乐器总音域当作每个乐句都应使用的范围。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "melody", "tessitura"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-003", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "melody", "tessitura"], "title_zh": "局部音域预算"}
{"action_zh": "用节奏、音程符号或终止落点中的至少一项维持动机可识别性。", "avoid_zh": "避免变奏同时改掉全部身份参数。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "motif", "identity"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-004", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "motif", "identity"], "title_zh": "动机最小身份"}
{"action_zh": "序列重复两至三次后改变结尾、缩短单元或转向终止，避免无限机械复制。", "avoid_zh": "避免把复制粘贴当作完整发展。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "sequence", "development"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-005", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "sequence", "development"], "title_zh": "序列的退出"}
{"action_zh": "回答句保留开头身份并改变末端方向、和声功能或闭合强度。", "avoid_zh": "避免前后句完全相同而没有句法差异。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "question answer", "phrase"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-006", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "question answer", "phrase"], "title_zh": "问答关系"}
{"action_zh": "一个短段落只设置一处最显著的音域、力度或密度峰值。", "avoid_zh": "避免多个参数在每小节都同时到顶。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "climax", "hierarchy"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-007", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "climax", "hierarchy"], "title_zh": "高潮稀缺"}
{"action_zh": "在长时值、休止或较稳定音上形成可感知分组，并让边界与和声句法协调。", "avoid_zh": "避免把等长事件流误当作自然乐句。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "breath", "phrase"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-008", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "breath", "phrase"], "title_zh": "旋律呼吸"}
{"action_zh": "开头用短基本想法清楚建立调性、节拍与动机身份。", "avoid_zh": "避免开头立即堆叠过多变化导致身份不明。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "presentation", "sentence"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-009", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "presentation", "sentence"], "title_zh": "乐句呈示"}
{"action_zh": "中段可用碎片化、序列、加速和声节奏或提高音区推动离开稳定区。", "avoid_zh": "避免延伸段完全重复呈示而没有方向。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "continuation", "sentence"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-010", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "continuation", "sentence"], "title_zh": "乐句延伸"}
{"action_zh": "结尾减少新材料，让旋律落点、低音与和声功能共同完成或保持开放。", "avoid_zh": "避免最后一拍才突然决定终止。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "conclusion", "cadence"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-011", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "conclusion", "cadence"], "title_zh": "乐句结论"}
{"action_zh": "前句建立开放终止，后句共享材料并给出更强闭合。", "avoid_zh": "避免两个半句终止强度完全相同。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "period", "phrase"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-012", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "period", "phrase"], "title_zh": "周期句差异"}
{"action_zh": "一至八小节只规划能在该长度内听见的微型句法。", "avoid_zh": "避免为四小节片段宣称完整奏鸣曲或交响展开。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "proportion", "scope"], "hard_constraint": true, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.9, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-013", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "proportion", "scope"], "title_zh": "短选区比例"}
{"action_zh": "制造对比时优先改变织体、音区、节奏密度或和声色彩中的一至两项。", "avoid_zh": "避免所有参数同时改变导致材料失去联系。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "contrast", "form"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-014", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "contrast", "form"], "title_zh": "对比参数限额"}
{"action_zh": "回归材料至少保留核心动机，同时允许结尾、音区或伴奏密度产生获得感。", "avoid_zh": "避免逐字复制或完全无关的新材料冒充回归。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "return", "form"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-015", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "return", "form"], "title_zh": "回归携带记忆"}
{"action_zh": "用和声不稳定度、音区、密度与节奏压缩中的少数参数共同塑造张力。", "avoid_zh": "避免只靠逐渐变响制造全部方向。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "tension", "coordination"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-016", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "tension", "coordination"], "title_zh": "张力多参数协同"}
{"action_zh": "闭合型调性乐句先建立主功能或稳定区域，再安排离开。", "avoid_zh": "避免在没有语境时直接把中间和弦当作终点。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "harmony", "tonic"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-017", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "harmony", "tonic"], "title_zh": "主功能起点"}
{"action_zh": "需要明确终止时让前属功能准备属功能，再决定是否回归主功能。", "avoid_zh": "避免功能进行无目标地左右倒退。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "harmony", "predominant dominant"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-018", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "harmony", "predominant dominant"], "title_zh": "前属到属"}
{"action_zh": "稳定区保持较慢和声节奏，终止或延伸处再有目的地加快。", "avoid_zh": "避免每个旋律事件触发新和弦。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "harmonic rhythm", "phrase"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-019", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "harmonic rhythm", "phrase"], "title_zh": "和声节奏分层"}
{"action_zh": "和声变化优先保留共同音，让其他声部走最短可解释路径。", "avoid_zh": "避免全部声部同时跳进制造无意重音。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "voice leading", "common tone"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-020", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "voice leading", "common tone"], "title_zh": "共同音连接"}
{"action_zh": "旋律与低音尽量形成反向或斜向运动，以加强独立和清晰度。", "avoid_zh": "避免长期严格同向平行造成外声部粘连。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "outer voices", "contrary motion"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-021", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "outer voices", "contrary motion"], "title_zh": "外声部方向"}
{"action_zh": "优先让低音清楚支持根音、转位或经过功能，再安排上方色彩。", "avoid_zh": "避免用随机最低音造成错误和声暗示。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "bass", "harmonic function"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-022", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "bass", "harmonic function"], "title_zh": "低音定义功能"}
{"action_zh": "内声部以最短移动、共同音和受控半音连接维持和声连续性。", "avoid_zh": "避免内声部比旋律更频繁大跳或交叉。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "inner voices", "economy"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-023", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "inner voices", "economy"], "title_zh": "内声部经济"}
{"action_zh": "终止评估结合低音、旋律落点、节拍位置、时值与后续停顿。", "avoid_zh": "避免看到 V–I 标签就自动判定强终止。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "cadence", "multi cue"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-024", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "cadence", "multi cue"], "title_zh": "终止不是和弦标签"}
{"action_zh": "问句、延伸或悬念目标可以停在属功能、持续音或非主音稳定点。", "avoid_zh": "避免所有短句都强制完全终止。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "cadence", "open ending"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-025", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "cadence", "open ending"], "title_zh": "开放终止用途"}
{"action_zh": "经过、邻接、延留和先现分别依据进入、离开与节拍位置判断。", "avoid_zh": "避免只按音级集合判断非和弦音是否合法。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "nonchord tone", "counterpoint"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-026", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "nonchord tone", "counterpoint"], "title_zh": "非和弦音分类"}
{"action_zh": "古典或严格对位目标下检查外声部连续平行五八度，并允许风格配置显式放宽。", "avoid_zh": "避免把体裁相关规则误作所有风格的硬禁令。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "parallel fifths", "style conditioning"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-027", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "parallel fifths", "style conditioning"], "title_zh": "平行完全协和检查"}
{"action_zh": "声部交叉只能作为短暂表达手段并保持身份可追踪；默认候选不新增交叉。", "avoid_zh": "避免持续交叉使声部角色不可辨认。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "voice crossing", "identity"], "hard_constraint": true, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.9, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-028", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "voice crossing", "identity"], "title_zh": "声部交叉用途"}
{"action_zh": "强拍承担结构落点，弱拍承担连接和装饰；切分后在句法关键点恢复拍感。", "avoid_zh": "避免所有细分位置获得同等结构重量。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "meter", "hierarchy"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-029", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "meter", "hierarchy"], "title_zh": "节拍层级"}
{"action_zh": "建立一至两个可识别节奏单元，通过位移、截短或尾部变化发展。", "avoid_zh": "避免每小节随机更换节奏词汇。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "rhythm", "motif"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-030", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "rhythm", "motif"], "title_zh": "核心节奏单元"}
{"action_zh": "节奏密度随乐句方向变化，并在终止前选择加速推动或稀疏收束。", "avoid_zh": "避免全段保持同一活动度。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "rhythm", "density"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-031", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "rhythm", "density"], "title_zh": "密度弧线"}
{"action_zh": "六八等复拍子保留大拍三分结构，跨组节奏必须仍能听出分组支点。", "avoid_zh": "避免把复拍子机械当成快速三四拍。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "compound meter", "grouping"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-032", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "compound meter", "grouping"], "title_zh": "复拍子分组"}
{"action_zh": "弱起材料应把重心导向后续强拍，并在句尾考虑相应时值回收。", "avoid_zh": "避免弱起只作为孤立装饰而破坏小节时值。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "anacrusis", "meter"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-033", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "anacrusis", "meter"], "title_zh": "弱起与回收"}
{"action_zh": "钢琴写作先区分主线、低音和填充，再根据手型分配而非只按音高分手。", "avoid_zh": "避免左右手长期争抢同一音区与同一节奏密度。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "piano", "hand roles"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize", "orchestration_advice"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-034", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "piano", "hand roles"], "title_zh": "钢琴双手角色"}
{"action_zh": "低音区采用较宽间距，中高音区可适度密集并保持旋律突出。", "avoid_zh": "避免低音区紧密堆叠造成浑浊。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "piano", "voicing"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize", "orchestration_advice"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-035", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "piano", "voicing"], "title_zh": "钢琴和弦间距"}
{"action_zh": "连续和弦优先保持共同音与相近手型，大跨度转换应留出时间或分解路径。", "avoid_zh": "避免理论上可按但连续动作代价过高。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "piano", "playability"], "hard_constraint": true, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize", "orchestration_advice"], "priority": 0.9, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-036", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "piano", "playability"], "title_zh": "钢琴手型连续"}
{"action_zh": "延音踏板只服务共鸣与连接，和声混浊或断裂声部不能依赖踏板掩盖。", "avoid_zh": "避免用踏板替代正确时值和声部进行。", "domain": "composition_craft", "goals": ["composition_craft", "piano", "pedal"], "hard_constraint": false, "instruments": ["general"], "meters": ["any"], "modes": ["theory_variation", "reharmonize", "orchestration_advice"], "priority": 0.82, "provenance": "sera_original_research_summary_v04", "rule_id": "KB-CRAFT-037", "styles": ["any"], "tags": ["composition_craft", "piano", "pedal"], "title_zh": "踏板非修复工具"}
